    "Inside every string value (resource, scope, span, event and link attributes, recursing into array and kvlist values): any absolute path up to site-packages/ becomes '/captured-site-packages/', the home directory becomes '/captured-home', and the local username and hostname become 'captured-user' / 'captured-host' (LiveKit's event_loop_blocked spans carry stack traces with local paths).",
